# Everything is ignored by default. This is deliberate.
#
# Tax documents land in this folder while you work: AIS, TIS, Form 26AS,
# broker P&L exports, pre-filled JSONs, finished returns. Those carry a PAN,
# an Aadhaar number, bank account numbers and a full home address. None of it
# belongs in a public repo, and a deny list only protects you against the
# filenames someone thought of in advance.
#
# So: nothing is tracked unless it is named below. To add a new project file,
# add an explicit "!" rule for it.

*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/SKILL.md

!/references/
!/references/**

!/scripts/
!/scripts/**

!/assets/
!/assets/**

!/schema/
!/schema/**

# Never, under any circumstances, even if a rule above would allow it.
work/
*.xls
*.xlsx
*_Prefill*.json
*_upload_*.json
*TIS*.pdf
*_16*.pdf
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
